<title>JAPAN: Nisshinbo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nisshinbo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 80.12		vs	   75.56</p>
<p> Operating	  448    million	  vs	  359    million</p>
<p> Current		1.75		vs	    1.55</p>
<p> Net		  831    million	  vs	    2.14</p>
